LiteRT Qualcomm dispatch library
--------------------------------
android/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libLiteRtDispatch_Qualcomm.so is
LiteRT's open-source Qualcomm NPU dispatch library (Google, Apache License
2.0), as built for flutter_edge_ai_litertlm (LiteRT-LM native-v0.18.0-e).

Qualcomm QNN runtime (not included)
-----------------------------------
Ramble Voice does not ship Qualcomm's QNN runtime. On a supported Snapdragon
phone the user may choose to download com.qualcomm.qti:qnn-runtime:2.50.0
from Maven Central, after accepting Qualcomm's AI Stack license, to run the
NPU model. It is proprietary Qualcomm software and is not covered by the GPL.
